#### allows same name for static and instance methods

- Verify: allows same name for static and instance methods
   - Expected: sum equals `30)  # oracle: value fixed by the spec contract`
   - Expected: calc.get_value() equals `100)  # oracle: value fixed by the spec contract`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

